The real-game example (examples/og2018-women-bronze-gbr-jpn.pcn) is derived
from a World Curling / CURLIT Results Book. World Curling and CURLIT hold the
rights to the underlying record. It is included as an example of the format
and is not covered by the licenses above.

This specification is an unofficial document with no affiliation to World
Curling or CURLIT.
